    "headline": "**Both orthant64 candidates fail the frozen source-retention gate. The implementation and full paired comparison are complete; neither candidate is promoted.**",
    "interpretation": "Likelihood retention, combined read/copy effect, noncollapse and mechanical/export checks pass in both arms. First-noun losses are11/8 against the immediate parents and11/9 against rung1, beyond the maximum2. Both indexed-complement utility discriminators pass: the index supplies17 additional complete answers over recent32 and lowers late-position NLL by0.110267/0.105152. That utility cannot override the retention failure. Restoring full access on the same final weights recovers10/8 complete answers, localizing much of the loss to the admission policy rather than an inability of those weights to use the information. Recent64 recovers the same27/25 complete answers with lower NLL than either tested indexed proposer. Exact-cache yields23/18, so it is not selected as the next bounded reference. These are same-weights interventions on one paired seed, not independently trained policy superiority.",
